B = [
    ('Rolls-Royce', 'Europe', '1950s-present', 'cars', 'In the style of Rolls-Royce, monumental, upright and hushed grandeur. Tall formal verticals, long smooth rolling volumes, flat slab surfaces and a single thin bright line drawn along the side. Mirror-polished metal with slim fluted vertical slats, deep lustrous colour in claret, silver sand, midnight blue or black, often in two tones with a lower band of silver. Hand-stitched cream or tan leather, deep wool pile, burr walnut veneer with fine inlay and weighty turned metal details. Dignified, imposing, effortless and quiet.'),
    ('Bentley', 'Europe', '1920s-30s and 1950s-present', 'cars', 'In the style of Bentley, muscular, wide and heavy British grandeur with a gentleman sporting edge. Powerful swelling haunches, a long forward mass, a deep sculpted shoulder and a low planted stance. Early work is open, riveted and raw in dark racing green with leather straps and visible fixings, later work is polished chrome, diamond-quilted leather in contrasting hides, knurled metal details and open-pore burr wood. Deep green, dark blue, silver, black and burgundy. Powerful, hand-finished and substantial.'),
    ('Jaguar', 'Europe', '1960s', 'cars', 'In the style of Jaguar, long, low, sensuous and feline. Very long sweeping lines, a tight compact core set far back and flowing curved surfaces that taper to a slim point on delicate supports. Smoothly faired forms under glass, fine bright metal detail and a single leaping animal motif. British racing green, signal red, cream, metallic silver-blue and opalescent grey. Red or tan leather, polished wood. Elegant speed, curvaceous and graceful.'),
    ('Aston Martin', 'Europe', '1960s and 2000s-present', 'cars', 'In the style of Aston Martin, lean, refined and quietly aggressive British elegance. A long stretched mass, a short overhang behind, a wide trapezoid mouth of horizontal slats in a bright surround, a low rakish line falling to a clipped end and a muscular flowing haunch under a crisp rising shoulder. Silver birch, racing green, midnight blue and gunmetal. Hand-stitched quilted leather, contrast piping, polished glass details, fine wood or carbon weave. Sleek, taut, understated and elegant.'),
    ('Mini', 'Europe', '1960s', 'cars', 'In the style of Mini, tiny, boxy, cheeky and playful. A compact two-box volume with everything pushed to the corners, very short overhangs, flat upright ends and a small lid-like top. Round chrome details, thin bright frames, visible welded seams, exposed hinges and slim edges. Bright colour in tartan red, island blue, white and racing green with a contrasting white top and long bold stripes. Bare minimal surfaces, rubber texture. Compact, friendly, honest and fun.'),
    ('Land Rover', 'Europe', '1950s-present', 'cars', 'In the style of Land Rover, rugged, honest and farmyard-tough utility. Flat slab aluminium panels, upright bluff faces, squared corners. Canvas coverings and strapped-on equipment worn openly. Matt olive green, bronze green, sand, poppy red and pale grey with white tops. Spartan painted metal, bare rubber, simple round faces and tough fabric. Utilitarian, hard-working and unpretentious. Rivets, bolts and seams are left visible, finishes are matt and wear is expected.'),
    ('Lotus', 'Europe', '1960s-70s', 'cars', 'In the style of Lotus, extremely low, light, stripped and track-bred. A thin fibreglass skin, a sharp wedge or rounded teardrop profile, a height barely above knee level, wide haunches and bare minimal edges tapering to a high end. Racing green with a bright yellow stripe, bright yellow, white, orange and metallic silver. Basic cramped spaces with thin moulded forms and exposed aluminium. Minimal, purposeful, nimble and lightweight.'),
    ('Morgan', 'Europe', '1930s-present', 'cars', 'In the style of Morgan, hand-built, charming and deliberately pre-war. Long louvred volumes, separate sweeping cycle-type curves, a narrow flat middle, a rounded end and a tall upright chrome front with a slim vertical bar. Aluminium over ash wood, folding canvas and leather straps. Racing green, claret, cream, navy and ivory with polished brass and chrome. Leather, polished wood and round white faces. Handcrafted, nostalgic and cheerful.'),
    ('Austin', 'Europe', '1930s-50s', 'cars', 'In the style of Austin, rounded, upright, sensible and homely British family comfort. Tall chrome uprights, curved separate forms, large round shapes set on the surface, side louvres, rounded volumes and narrow bright edges. Black, maroon, deep green, grey and cream, often two-tone. Beige or maroon leather. Stately, modest, dependable and comfortable. Thin steel with chrome caps, thick carpet, polished wood and softly padded comfort throughout.'),
    ('Triumph', 'Europe', '1960s', 'cars', 'In the style of Triumph, breezy, sporty and affordable open-air British fun. A long low mass, a tidy tapering end, chrome edges, rounded sculpted surfaces with one crisp crease and a folding black cloth top. Signal red, white, British racing green, pale yellow and deep blue. Black or red vinyl moulded forms, wood or painted panels. Jaunty, compact and cheerful.'),
    ('MG', 'Europe', '1930s and 1960s', 'cars', 'In the style of MG, small, jaunty British open sports spirit. A tall upright chrome front of vertical slats under an octagon motif, a long flat louvred top, cutaway sides, cycle-type curves and a rounded end. Racing green, red, cream, ivory and pale blue. Red or black leather, engine-turned or wooden panels. Spirited, cheerful, plucky and simple. Wire-spoke patterns, chrome-rimmed dials and a low folding screen add period charm.'),
    ('Volkswagen', 'Europe', '1950s-60s', 'cars', 'In the style of Volkswagen, cute, honest, friendly and economical. One smooth continuous beetle-like curve with a domed top, rounded ends, bug-eye round forms standing up from the surface. Pastel beige, sea blue, coral red, mint green, ivory and cream. Bare painted metal interiors, plain cloth or vinyl and exposed painted panels. Simple, rounded, practical and charming. Slim chrome edges and tiny oval windows keep ornament to a minimum.'),
    ('Porsche', 'Europe', '1960s-present', 'cars', 'In the style of Porsche, compact, balanced, purposeful and athletic. A smooth teardrop profile with one sloping line falling from front to back, round forms rising from flared surfaces, wide muscular haunches and short overhangs. Thin full-width bands of light in modern work. Guards red, silver grey, signal orange, racing yellow, pale blue and black. A tiny crest with a rearing horse. Black leather, houndstooth cloth and aluminium trim.'),
    ('BMW', 'Europe', '1970s-80s', 'cars', 'In the style of BMW, precise, driver-focused and understated sporty design. A crisp three-box shape, thin supports, a generous glasshouse, a low nose with two slim vertical oval openings framed by chrome bars and one sharp shoulder line running end to end. A slight forward-leaning shark stance. Cross-spoke patterns and a blue and white roundel. Silver, bright blue, henna red, black, white and fjord grey. Black cloth or leather, clear round faces and plain brushed trim.'),
    ('Mercedes-Benz', 'Europe', '1960s-80s', 'cars', 'In the style of Mercedes-Benz, upright, dignified, solid and formal engineering. Tall bright verticals crowned by a three-pointed star, wide bright surrounds, flat sides with sharp creases, thin supports beneath generous glass and chunky edges with rubber strips. Champagne, ivory, signal red, midnight blue, silver grey and black. Wide tufted velour or leather, walnut trim and large rotary details. Substantial, formal, safe and meticulous.'),
    ('Audi', 'Europe', '1980s-present', 'cars', 'In the style of Audi, clean, precise, taut and technical. A large single-frame hexagonal shape with horizontal bars in a bright or black surround, four interlocking rings, sharp tight surfaces, a taut shoulder line, flush glass and crisp LED light signatures. Glacier white, grey, black, tango red and navy. A flat machined look, aluminium trim, perfect panel gaps, black or grey leather and digital displays. Crisp, engineered and understated.'),
    ('Opel', 'Europe', '1960s-70s', 'cars', 'In the style of Opel, neat, compact, sporty and stylish mass-market design. A wide low stance, a rectangular black-mesh panel with a lightning bolt mark, a waist that swells and rises toward the end, small chrome edges, thin supports, a gently curved sloping line and flared arches. Signal yellow, bright orange, lime green, white and sky blue. Checked cloth or vinyl and simple round faces. Tidy, youthful and sporty.'),
    ('Citroen', 'Europe', '1950s-70s', 'cars', 'In the style of Citroen, futuristic, quirky, avant-garde and comfortable. A low streamlined teardrop body that seems to crouch, a narrowly tapering end, smooth skirts covering the lower edges, minimal slot openings and a double chevron mark. Pale green, ivory, grey blue and sand beige, or bold orange and brown, with white tops. Checked cloth. Interiors are very low, with checked cloth, pod-shaped instruments and odd plastic details.'),
    ('Peugeot', 'Europe', '1980s-2000s', 'cars', 'In the style of Peugeot, neat, compact, well-proportioned and sporty. A clean wedge profile, a small rampant lion mark, a rectangular black panel between slim wraparound shapes, smooth uncluttered flanks with one crisp line, black plastic edges and a rising beltline. White, bright red, ocean blue, silver, dark green and black. Deep-pile cloth. Tidy, practical and lively. Deep-pile cloth, grey plastic and thin stalks keep interiors clear and sporty.'),
    ('Renault', 'Europe', '1970s-80s', 'cars', 'In the style of Renault, cheerful, functional, boxy and French-practical. A square profile, flat surfaces, huge flat rectangular shapes, a large diamond mark centred on a flat black field, flat side panels with plastic rub strips and fat black edges. Bright orange, yellow, vivid red, light blue, off-white and beige metallic. Bold striped or checked cloth and flat black or brown panels. Compact, sunny and unfussy.'),
    ('Bugatti', 'Europe', '1930s', 'cars', 'In the style of Bugatti, sensuous, artistic, elegant and aristocratic coachbuilt sculpture. A tall horseshoe-shaped nickel-polished front with a small red oval mark, fine louvres, flowing swept curves, a boat-tail or teardrop end and steeply raked glass. French racing blue, black over red, deep cream and two-tone schemes with a polished metal spine. Soft red or brown leather, engine-turned aluminium and small round faces.'),
    ('Delahaye', 'Europe', '1930s', 'cars', 'In the style of Delahaye, flamboyant, theatrical, curvaceous Art Deco coachwork. Very long sweeping lines, a teardrop body, pontoon forms flowing over the base, a long mass running into a sloping end, fine chrome bars and chrome spears running through the curves. Two-tone schemes such as ivory over dark blue, silver over burgundy and deep black. Cream or red leather and engine-turned metal with round faces.'),
    ('Alfa Romeo', 'Europe', '1960s-70s', 'cars', 'In the style of Alfa Romeo, passionate, lively and graceful Italian sports design. A low slim body with a distinctive triangular shield flanked by mesh, a circular emblem with a red cross and crowned serpent, rounded forms under glass, a long mass and pointed tapering end. Chrome edges. Alfa red, white, light blue, silver and dark green. Bucket forms, wood and drilled aluminium and deep-set round faces add a racing note.'),
    ('Ferrari', 'Europe', '1960s-80s', 'cars', 'In the style of Ferrari, sensual, dramatic and fast. A low wide body with a long curved or wedge-shaped front, round or pop-up light shapes, egg-crate mesh, curvy haunches and a sloping line with flying buttresses or side strakes. A prancing black horse on a yellow shield. Rosso red, giallo yellow, silver, black and dark blue. Tan or black leather and exposed metal gate details.'),
    ('Lamborghini', 'Europe', '1970s-80s', 'cars', 'In the style of Lamborghini, brash, theatrical and futuristic. Razor-sharp creases and a body barely waist-high. Louvres, scissor-style panels rising up, flat black louvred surfaces and wide hips. A golden bull on a black shield. Vivid lime green, orange, yellow, white, red and purple. Extreme, dramatic and showy. Interiors are angular black leather with wedge-shaped panels, pod dials and small switches.'),
    ('Maserati', 'Europe', '1960s-present', 'cars', 'In the style of Maserati, graceful, smooth, refined and elegant Italian grand touring. A long mass, a tight sloping line, a large oval shape with vertical chrome bars bearing a trident mark, boomerang-shaped forms and wide sculpted haunches. Deep blue, silver, dark burgundy, pearl white and black. Tan, red or cream leather with fine stitching. Polished wood or carbon trim and an analogue clock at the centre of the panel add refinement.'),
    ('Lancia', 'Europe', '1950s-80s', 'cars', 'In the style of Lancia, refined, finely detailed, understated and intellectual with a gentle sporty edge. A narrow shield-shaped chrome front, a small flag mark bearing a lance, tidy proportions, delicate supports, generous glass, thin chrome trim along the flanks and a slightly tapered end. Rally work has boxy flared arches, white or grey tops and wide blue and red stripes. Pale grey, midnight blue, cream, ivory and rich burgundy. Wool or velour and wood veneer.'),
    ('Fiat', 'Europe', '1950s-70s', 'cars', 'In the style of Fiat, tiny, round, cheerful and playful post-war Italian city design. A bulbous egg-shaped body, tiny bug-like round forms, a flat or lightly curved top sometimes rolled open as canvas and thin chrome edges. Pastel yellow, powder blue, light green, cream, cherry red and white. Bare metal interiors painted in the body colour, a single round face and simple vinyl or fabric.'),
    ('Volvo', 'Europe', '1960s-90s', 'cars', 'In the style of Volvo, boxy, upright, sturdy, safe and rational Swedish design. A flat top surface, a large diagonal strip bearing a circle with arrow mark, square shapes, upright supports, a flat-sided body with a thin crease, black edges with rubber trim and a long flat roofline. Beige, forest green, mustard, silver, white and dark blue. Thick supportive plaid cloth or leather and flat panels with large clear faces.'),
    ('Saab', 'Europe', '1970s-80s', 'cars', 'In the style of Saab, aeronautical, quirky, practical and eccentric Swedish design. A short stubby nose sloping down, deeply curved glass, a rounded cockpit-like core and rectangular forms. A small gryphon head on a red circle, black plastic edges and one distinctive curved support. Alloys with a distinct hole pattern. Black, silver metallic, deep red, white and dark blue. Deep moulded forms in grey or blue cloth and an asymmetrical wraparound panel with big round faces.'),
    ('Tatra', 'Europe', '1930s-40s', 'cars', 'In the style of Tatra, streamlined, futuristic, odd and aerodynamic. A long smooth teardrop body, a central spine-like fin running down the back, a tapering end with rows of cooling louvres, smooth flush sides and curved skirted forms. Disc patterns with chrome caps and bright trim used sparingly. Dark green, black, metallic grey and burgundy. Wide soft cloth or leather and warm wooden panelling with simple round faces. Eccentric, engineered and slightly strange.'),
    ('Skoda', 'Europe', '1960s-80s', 'cars', 'In the style of Skoda, small, plain, boxy, honest and rugged Czech design. A flat top surface, round forms, a simple small opening, chrome-rimmed edges, a smooth unfussy body, slim roofline. A winged arrow mark. Pale beige, olive green, sky blue, mustard yellow and brick red. Plain vinyl and flat plastic panels in grey or brown. Modest, utilitarian and unpretentious.'),
    ('Trabant', 'Europe', '1960s-80s', 'cars', 'In the style of Trabant, tiny, boxy, austere, humble and slightly smoky East German design. A flat top surface, pressed plastic panels, flat sides, square corners with slight rounding, round forms, small chrome edges. Pastel pale blue, beige, sage green, orange and white with a faded matt finish. A bare flat interior and plain hard vinyl. Pressed plastic panels and a thin faded look give honest austerity.'),
    ('Seat', 'Europe', '1970s-80s', 'cars', 'In the style of Seat, compact, square-cut, sunny, simple and affordable Spanish design. A flat top surface, a plain rectangular panel, square forms, black plastic edges, crisp straight body lines, a flat roof, boxy glass and flat sides. A small stylised S mark and tidy rectangular forms. Bright red, yellow, white, silver and dark blue. Striped cloth and flat panels with simple round faces.'),
    ('Alpine', 'Europe', '1960s-70s', 'cars', 'In the style of Alpine, tiny, rounded, low, nimble, light and rallying French sportiness. A fibreglass body with a swooping curved roofline, smooth rounded forms, a small oval air intake, very low glass and a sloping end. Small wide steel or alloy shapes with chrome nuts. Bright blue, orange, white and yellow, often with stripes along the top. Cloth and vinyl moulded forms and simple panels with round faces. Playful, compact and fast.'),
    ('Koenigsegg', 'Europe', '2000s-present', 'cars', 'In the style of Koenigsegg, hyper-sleek, exotic, clean and ultra-technical Swedish engineering. A low wide body, narrow slit shapes, panels that swing up and out and exposed bare carbon-fibre weave under clear lacquer. Ice blue, gloss white, orange and gunmetal. A ghost-like shield mark. Minimal interiors of carbon, leather and aluminium. Hollow carbon or forged five-spoke shapes and a bare carbon weave under clear lacquer keep it technical.'),
    ('Spyker', 'Europe', '2000s', 'cars', 'In the style of Spyker, bold, eccentric, ornate Dutch hand-built luxury that mixes aircraft cues with opulence. A circular hub-like centre with spoke-like bars radiating from it, a bulging body with exposed round forms and a compact core. Polished multi-spoke turbine-like patterns. Bright orange, lime green, black, silver and pearl white. Diamond-quilted leather in contrasting colours, exposed turned aluminium, big round white faces and a cockpit feel. Mechanical jewellery, eccentric and showy.'),
    ('Simca', 'Europe', '1950s-60s', 'cars', 'In the style of Simca, jaunty, post-war and optimistic French pontoon design. A rounded body, a wide-mouth chrome opening, round forms, wraparound glass, chrome trim strips along the flanks, a rounded end with chrome edges, a swallow mark and pastel two-tone paint. Cream over sea green, pink over grey, turquoise and sand. Bench forms in vinyl and cloth and chrome-ringed dials keep the mood sunny.'),
    ('Hispano-Suiza', 'Europe', '1920s-30s', 'cars', 'In the style of Hispano-Suiza, aristocratic, grand and sculptural luxury touring of the 1920s and 1930s. A long louvred mass, a tall narrow chrome front, large freestanding round forms. Deep blue, burgundy, black and silver with polished brass or nickel brightwork. Deep buttoned leather. Wire spokes, flowing separate wings and coachbuilt bodies in polished wood or aluminium add craftsmanship, with polished burr walnut and brass-bezelled instruments inside.'),
    ('Bristol', 'Europe', '1950s-70s', 'cars', 'In the style of Bristol, discreet, reserved, hand-built and clubby British grand touring with an aircraft-inspired shape. A long mass, a smooth aerodynamic body, a gently curved roof. Dark green, grey, cream, black and claret. Deep leather, polished walnut and clear round faces. Small oval nose with twin kidney-shaped openings, round forms set in the wings and hidden details behind flaps add quiet eccentricity.'),
    ('Facel Vega', 'Europe', '1950s-60s', 'cars', 'In the style of Facel Vega, rich, glamorous and jet-age French grand touring. A long mass, stacked shapes in vertical pairs, wraparound glass with thin supports, large chrome edges, a flat end and chrome side strips. Black, silver, bright red, cream and deep blue. Leather. Wire spokes, an egg-crate mesh set low and white-faced dials with toggle switches in polished metal add glamour.'),
    ('Pagani', 'Europe', '2000s-present', 'cars', 'In the style of Pagani, jewel-like, rounded and artisan handcrafted Italian hypercar design. A rounded organic body, exposed carbon weave and fine polished aluminium details. Deep blue, silver, black and tricolour stripes. Milled aluminium, exposed carbon, tan leather in fine stitching and many tiny details. A tall carbon wing, fine stitching and milled aluminium controls make every small detail a jewel.'),
    ('DS', 'Europe', '1950s-60s', 'cars', 'In the style of DS, futuristic, serene and floating, like a spaceship. A streamlined body that tapers narrowly at the back, a floating white fibreglass roof, a very low front with a simple slit opening, forms behind glass, smooth skirts over the lower edges, thin supports and a chevron mark. Pale grey, ivory, sea green, pastel blue and sand. Plush cloth or leather and a panel shaped in smooth curves.'),
    ('Ford', 'North America', '1960s', 'cars', 'In the style of Ford, honest, approachable, everyday mass-market American design of the 1960s. A long mass, short end, wide low stance, a sharp scalloped crease along the side and a chrome strip along the flank. White, poppy red, turquoise, pale yellow and dark green with moderate chrome. Plain steel with chrome caps, vinyl bench forms and woodgrain trim keep it everyday.'),
    ('Chevrolet', 'North America', '1950s', 'cars', 'In the style of Chevrolet, cheerful, optimistic diner-era American design of the 1950s. A wide egg-crate mesh, bright chrome edges with round bullet guards, twin chrome rocket ornaments and sharply pointed upswept trim. A sweeping two-tone side spear, wraparound glass, whitewall roundness and generous chrome. Two-tone vinyl with chrome-ringed round faces. Turquoise and ivory, coral and white. Sunny, glossy and confident.'),
    ('Cadillac', 'North America', '1959', 'cars', 'In the style of Cadillac, excessive, glamorous, jet-age opulence of vast length and width. Heavy chrome edges with large conical guards, a jewelled egg-crate mesh, dual stacked shapes, a long flat mass, a thin hardtop roof, stainless trim and a wreath and crest mark. Pink, pearl white, powder blue and black with chrome everywhere. Tufted leather. Towering pointed upswept fins with twin bullet forms and thick carpets exaggerate length and glitter.'),
    ('Buick', 'North America', '1950s', 'cars', 'In the style of Buick, comfortable middle-class luxury of the 1950s, rounded and heavily chromed, dignified rather than flashy. A toothy chrome front like a wide smile, large round chrome guards, a row of three or four round portholes along each side, a sweeping chrome side spear, a slightly bulbous body. A tri-shield mark. Cream, sea green, coral and maroon.'),
    ('Pontiac', 'North America', '1960s-70s', 'cars', 'In the style of Pontiac, aggressive, swaggering street-racer American muscle of the 1960s and 70s. A split twin-nostril front divided by a body-coloured beak, stacked or hidden shapes, a waistline swelling over the back, tall haunches. Brushed metal rally patterns with bright trim rings. Carousel red, deep green, ivory and bright orange. A long top with a raised scoop, bold stripes, a red arrowhead mark and black vinyl bucket forms with engine-turned panels add attitude.'),
    ('Dodge', 'North America', '1970s', 'cars', 'In the style of Dodge, brutal, loud, cartoonish tough-guy American muscle of the early 1970s. A wide aggressive stance, a long flat mass with bulging twin humps, squared-off edges with a pronounced hip and a bold bumblebee stripe or band. A ducktail kick at the end, slotted metal textures, black vinyl and chunky proportions. High-impact violet, lime green, purple, bright orange and pale green, with a ram or red stripe mark. Swaggering, noisy and showy.'),
    ('Chrysler', 'North America', '1957-1960s', 'cars', 'In the style of Chrysler, late 1950s and early 60s forward-look American design, space-age, optimistic and airy. A long slender profile, a huge expanse of glass in a wraparound screen, a wide-mouth front with a bright bar and flowing side chrome with a contrasting colour panel. Sculpted panels and luxurious fabric. Turquoise, flamingo pink, cream and charcoal. Tall swept-back fins and push-button controls feel optimistic and space-age.'),
    ('Lincoln', 'North America', '1960s', 'cars', 'In the style of Lincoln, understated, sober, expensive American flagship luxury of the 1960s. A slab-sided perfectly flat body, a thin knife-edge beltline, a restrained bright front of fine horizontal bars, a long level top, a square formal roofline, a star mark in a plain rectangle, minimal chrome in a thin shoulder strip and slim vertical forms. Inside, flat panels with brushed metal and deep leather with a feeling of grave dignity. Black, midnight blue, silver and white.'),
    ('Jeep', 'North America', '1940s-present', 'cars', 'In the style of Jeep, rugged, utilitarian, honest, military-derived adventure design. A flat boxy body, a seven-slot upright front flanked by round forms, squared-off arches, short overhangs, soft canvas or hard tops. Olive drab, sand, desert tan, safety yellow and bright orange. Exposed hinges and bolts, heavy black plastic flares, tall knobby tyres and red tow hooks suit hose-down interiors with bare painted metal and grab handles.'),
    ('Tesla', 'North America', '2010s-present', 'cars', 'In the style of Tesla, minimalist, clean, futuristic and software-first electric design. Smooth unbroken surfaces, a low sloping line, slim LED shapes, a thin horizontal band of light, a large glass roof. Aerodynamic turbine-style patterns with flat covers, body-coloured trim and almost no chrome. Pearl white, solid black, deep blue metallic, midnight silver and red. A closed-off nose, flush handles and a single huge landscape touchscreen in a stark white or black interior remove all buttons.'),
    ('Studebaker', 'North America', '1950s', 'cars', 'In the style of Studebaker, quirky, futuristic and a bit strange American design of the 1950s. A low wide stance, a slim body, a low roofline, an almost European flat-sided silhouette and a gently tapering end. Chrome edges. Gold or turquoise hardtops. Pale pastel two-tone paint in pink and white, sky blue and cream. A pointed bullet nose like an aircraft spinner and a streamlined panel with a big round dial and brushed metal add oddness.'),
    ('Packard', 'North America', '1930s-40s', 'cars', 'In the style of Packard, stately, hushed, old-money American luxury of the 1930s and 40s. A tall narrow ox-yoke front shaped like a pointed shield with fine vertical bars, a very long mass. Deep gloss black, maroon, dark green and cream with a thin coach line. Walnut veneer, mohair or leather and elegant engine-turned metal. Wire or disc patterns with whitewall tyres, a chrome flying mascot and sweeping separate fenders add old-money poise.'),
    ('Hudson', 'North America', '1948-1954', 'cars', 'In the style of Hudson, hunkered, bathtub-shaped and solid American design of the late 1940s and early 1950s. A step-down body with a very low floor, a wide low simple chrome front with a triangle mark, a smooth slab end, a sloping roofline, skirted lower edges, a heavy brow and a rounded end. Two-tone paint in maroon and cream, deep green and tan.'),
    ('Oldsmobile', 'North America', '1950s-60s', 'cars', 'In the style of Oldsmobile, jet-age, confident and glossy American rocket-themed optimism. A bright wide face with a central round jet-like form, long sweeping chrome lines down each flank, wraparound glass and a roof on thin supports. Chrome with spinning centres and gleaming bright trim throughout. Rocket red, white, mint green and sky blue, laid out as two-tone vinyl and shining surfaces. Streamlined, speedy motifs repeated everywhere. Cheerful, polished and forward-looking.'),
    ('DeSoto', 'North America', '1950s', 'cars', 'In the style of DeSoto, dramatic and theatrical American showmanship of the mid to late 1950s. A tall vertical oval face like a pursed mouth, heavy chrome brows, sharply pointed upswept edges with arrow-shaped trim and one long sweeping chrome spear that splits two-tone paint. Hooded, wraparound glass, plush fabric and a bold sculpted panel. Pink and charcoal, turquoise and white, sunset orange. Flamboyant, confident and a little overblown.'),
    ('Edsel', 'North America', '1958-1960', 'cars', 'In the style of Edsel, overwrought, odd and unforgettable American design. A tall vertical horse-collar front set in the middle of a wide bar, wingtip boomerang forms, side sculpting with a bright spear and a cut-away dip along the side. Two-tone pink and black, turquoise and white, yellow and brown. Pillarless hardtops, chrome rims with whitewalls and a rolling-dome gauge add oddness.'),
    ('Tucker', 'North America', '1948', 'cars', 'In the style of Tucker, futuristic and streamlined rear-engined American design. A very low, smooth, rounded body like a teardrop, a narrow chrome-bar front with a wide mouth, a swept-back roof. Chrome edges, a thin trim line. A padded interior. Waltz blue, beige, maroon and dark green. Small whitewall tyres, a central gauge cluster and a fully enclosed louvred end add futurism.'),
    ('DeLorean', 'North America', '1980s', 'cars', 'In the style of DeLorean, matte, metallic, sci-fi, raw and unfinished. A flat angular wedge of bare brushed stainless steel panels with visible grain and no paint, razor-sharp creases and a low long profile. Upward-opening gull-wing panels, flat louvred covers, black plastic edges, slim flat shapes in a plain black strip and dished five-spoke shapes in dark grey. Grey leather with a simple flat panel and rectangular pods. Cold, angular and futuristic.'),
    ('Plymouth', 'North America', '1957-1970', 'cars', 'In the style of Plymouth, bold and cheeky American design from the late 1950s through the 1960s. A flat wide bright front with a sailing-ship mark, long sculpted flanks with a sweeping two-tone chrome sweep, a very low top, a full-width chrome bar and a large thin roof. Purple, vivid orange, lemon yellow and bright green. Sharp tall tail fins that blade backward, a tall spoiler and loud decals with a cartoon bird add cheek.'),
    ('Mercury', 'North America', '1949-1950s', 'cars', 'In the style of Mercury, low, mean and smooth custom-friendly American design of the late 1940s and 1950s. A smooth rounded slab body, an optional low chopped roofline, fat round guards, teardrop fender lines flowing into the sides, a sloping line, small forms in a rounded end and a chrome strip along the flank. Skirted lower edges. Candy maroon, primer grey, gloss black and cream.'),
]
